    <bpmn:process id="W_W1190" name="W1190. Inter-Island DC-to-Store RoRo &amp; Ferry Consolidated Shipment Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly inter-island shipment planning cycle; or ad-hoc upon vessel schedule change
Frequency: Weekly planning; ~15–25 inter-island shipments/month (DC2 Cebu → Visayas/Mindanao islands, DC3 Laguna → Visayas via Batangas port)
Volume: ~30–40% of outbound deliveries involve inter-island routing (Philippine archipelago logistics)
Owner: Logistics Manager
Participants: Logistics Manager, DC Dispatch, Shipping Coordinator, 3PL Partner (RoRo/ferry operator), Store Managers (island stores)
Source: workflow W1190 — Inter-Island DC-to-Store RoRo &amp; Ferry Consolidated Shipment Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1190_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1190_Lane1" name="Logistics Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1190_Lane2" name="Shipping Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1190_Lane3" name="DC Dispatch">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1190_Lane4" name="3PL Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1190_Lane5" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1190_End16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1190_Start7" name="Weekly inter-island shipment planning cycle; or ad-hoc upon vessel schedule change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task8" name="Weekly inter-island shipment plan">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Weekly inter-island shipment plan: Every Monday, Logistics Manager reviews the week&#x27;s replenishment orders for island-bound stores; consolidates orders by destination island group (e.g., Panay, Negros, Bohol, Leyte, Samar) to maximize truck utilization per vessel sailing
Responsible (R): Logistics Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task9" name="Vessel booking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vessel booking: Shipping Coordinator books space on scheduled RoRo vessels (e.g., 2GO, Montenegro Lines, Cokaliong) or cargo barges; confirms sailing date, ETD, ETA, and vessel capacity; obtains booking confirmation number; books return passage for empty trucks if 3PL partner operates dedicated vehicles
Responsible (R): Shipping Coordinator
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task10" name="Load consolidation and dispatch">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Load consolidation and dispatch: DC Dispatch consolidates orders for each vessel sailing into truck loads; prioritizes by store urgency (stockout risk) and product category (cement and lumber before tiles to prevent damage); seals trucks with tamper-evident seals; records seal numbers in ERP
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 1 hour/sailing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task11" name="Port check-in and vessel loading">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Port check-in and vessel loading: 3PL driver or company driver proceeds to origin port (e.g., Cebu port for DC2, Batangas port for DC3); presents booking confirmation and cargo manifest to port authority; vehicle boards RoRo vessel; system updates shipment status to &quot;At Port — Loaded&quot;
Responsible (R): 3PL Driver
Accountable (A): Shipping Coordinator
Duration: 2–4 hours (port processing)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task12" name="In-transit monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: In-transit monitoring: System tracks vessel sailing schedule; Logistics Manager monitors for delays due to weather, port congestion, or mechanical issues; proactively notifies destination store managers of revised ETA
Responsible (R): Logistics Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task13" name="Port arrival and island delivery">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Port arrival and island delivery: Vessel arrives at destination port; truck disembarks; driver proceeds to store(s) for delivery; Goods Receipt processed per standard store receiving (W109); for multi-store island routes, driver follows multi-drop plan
Responsible (R): 3PL Driver / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 4–8 hours (port to stores)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1190_Task14" name="Freight cost reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Freight cost reconciliation: System captures inter-island freight costs (vessel fee, port charges, driver accommodation for overnight sailings); allocates freight cost to delivered orders; AP Clerk reconciles freight invoices from vessel operators and 3PL partners
Responsible (R): System / AP Clerk
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1190_Task15" name="Monthly inter-island logistics review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Monthly inter-island logistics review: Logistics Manager reviews monthly inter-island KPIs: (a) on-time delivery % (target: ≥ 85%), (b) average transit time by route, (c) freight cost per kg/cbm by route, (d) vessel delay frequency, (e) damage rate during inter-island transit
Responsible (R): Logistics Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1190_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1190_End16" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1190_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1190_Annotation17">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-256 (ensure controlled execution — Outbound Distribution (PA-06.1).) | - operational: Logistics Manager review and approval gate on booking buffers and island safety-stock levels; load-securing compliance check before dispatch, sealed trucks, and damage claim process with vessel operator
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1190_Assoc18" sourceRef="W1190_Annotation17" targetRef="W1190_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1190_Flow19" sourceRef="W1190_Start7" targetRef="W1190_Task8" />
