    <bpmn:process id="W_W1228" name="W1228. DC Multi-Stop Route Optimization &amp; Dynamic Load Consolidation for Store Delivery" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily dispatch planning window (morning); store replenishment orders ready for shipment
Frequency: Daily per DC; ~15–20 outbound loads/day per DC
Volume: 4 DCs × ~18 loads/day × average 2.5 stops per route = ~180 multi-stop deliveries/day
Owner: DC Dispatch Planner
Participants: DC Dispatch Planner, DC Supervisor, Truck Driver, Store Receiving Clerk
Source: workflow W1228 — DC Multi-Stop Route Optimization &amp; Dynamic Load Consolidation for Store Delivery</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1228_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1228_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1228_Lane2" name="DC Dispatch Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1228_Lane3" name="Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1228_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1228_Start5" name="Daily dispatch planning window (morning); store replenishment orders ready for shipment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1228_Task6" name="Order-to-route assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Order-to-route assignment: System auto-groups pending store replenishment orders by: (a) destination store location (geographic clustering); (b) delivery priority (urgent vs. standard); (c) order size vs. truck capacity (10-wheeler: ~20 tons; 6-wheeler: ~8 tons); (d) special handling requirements (hazmat per W236, catch-weight lumber, fragile tiles)
Responsible (R): System / DC Dispatch Planner
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1228_Task7" name="Route optimization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Route optimization: System calculates optimized multi-stop routes: (a) minimize total route distance/time; (b) respect truck ban hours per W431; (c) respect delivery time windows per store; (d) account for Philippine road conditions (bridge weight limits, narrow roads to provincial stores); (e) sequence stops for efficient unloading (heavy/bulky items first)
Responsible (R): System / DC Dispatch Planner
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1228_Task8" name="Load consolidation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Load consolidation: DC Dispatch Planner consolidates orders into truck loads: (a) match order volume/weight to truck capacity; (b) combine orders for stores on same route; (c) prioritize full-truckload (FTL) over less-than-truckload (LTL); (d) allocate remaining LTL to 3PL partners per W242
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch Planner
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1228_Task9" name="Truck dispatch &amp; driver assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Truck dispatch &amp; driver assignment: (a) assign route to owned or 3PL truck; (b) assign driver per availability and certification per W197; (c) generate load manifest with stop sequence, delivery documents per store; (d) brief driver on route, special instructions, and delivery priorities
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch Planner
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1228_Task10" name="In-transit tracking &amp; dynamic rerouting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: In-transit tracking &amp; dynamic rerouting: (a) GPS/telematics track truck location per W199; (b) if traffic, road closure, or delay: system suggests alternative route; (c) notify affected stores of updated ETA; (d) for critical delays: DC Dispatch Planner coordinates with Store Manager for adjusted receiving window
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch Planner / Driver
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1228_Task11" name="Proof of delivery &amp; route closure">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Proof of delivery &amp; route closure: (a) driver obtains store receiving signature per W109; (b) system captures GPS location and timestamp at each delivery stop; (c) all stops completed: route closed in system; (d) exceptions (missed stops, refused deliveries) flagged for resolution
Responsible (R): Driver / Store Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 5 min/stop</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1228_Task12" name="Weekly route analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Weekly route analytics: DC Dispatch Planner reviews: (a) routes per day, stops per route, utilization rate; (b) on-time delivery % per store; (c) cost per delivery per route; (d) identify routes for consolidation or splitting; (e) benchmark owned vs. 3PL cost per delivery
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch Planner
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1228_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1228_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1228_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1228_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-256 (ensure controlled execution — Outbound Distribution (PA-06.1).) | - operational: DC Dispatch Planner review and approval gate
Owner: DC Dispatch Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1228_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1228_Annotation14" targetRef="W1228_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
