    <bpmn:process id="W_W1255" name="W1255. Inter-Island Consolidated Shipping, Vessel Booking &amp; RoRo Space Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled — weekly vessel booking cycle; ad-hoc triggered by replenishment order backlog exceeding DC-to-store transit threshold or vessel schedule disruption
Frequency: Weekly vessel booking for DC2 (Cebu/Visayas) and DC4 (Clark/North Luzon); 2–3 inter-island shipments per week per DC
Volume: ~8–12 inter-island vessel bookings per month; ~40–60 container/trailer movements per month across all inter-island routes
Owner: Logistics Planner (Inter-Island)
Participants: DC Operations Manager, Logistics Planner, Shipping Line Representative, 3PL Transport Coordinator, Finance Controller
Source: workflow W1255 — Inter-Island Consolidated Shipping, Vessel Booking &amp; RoRo Space Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1255_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1255_Lane1" name="Logistics Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1255_Lane2" name="DC Shift Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1255_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1255_Start4" name="Scheduled — weekly vessel booking cycle; ad-hoc triggered by replenishment order backlog…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1255_Task5" name="Weekly shipment consolidation planning">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Weekly shipment consolidation planning: Logistics Planner reviews all pending store replenishment orders for inter-island destinations: (a) group orders by destination island group (Visayas, Mindanao, North Luzon via RoRo); (b) calculate total cubic volume and weight per destination; (c) determine optimal vessel type: container vessel (for &gt; 15 CBM consolidated loads) or RoRo ferry (for vehicle-mounted loads &lt; 15 CBM); (d) identify consolidation opportunities — combine multiple store orders into single vessel booking to achieve FCL (full container load) rates vs. more expensive LCL (less than container load) rates
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 3 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1255_Task6" name="Vessel space booking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vessel space booking: Logistics Planner books vessel space with shipping line or RoRo operator: (a) select vessel based on: (i) departure schedule alignment with DC ready-to-ship date, (ii) transit time vs. store replenishment SLA, (iii) rate per CBM or per container; (b) for container vessel: book 20ft or 40ft container based on consolidated volume; (c) for RoRo: book vehicle deck space (trailer, wing van) — confirm maximum weight and height restrictions; (d) obtain booking confirmation with vessel name, voyage number, ETD, ETA; (e) enter booking details into ERP transport planning module
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1255_Task7" name="Load plan &amp; dispatch">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Load plan &amp; dispatch: DC pick/pack team prepares consolidated shipment: (a) generate pick list sorted by destination store for consolidated container; (b) load container or vehicle in reverse delivery sequence (last store delivery loaded first); (c) apply store-specific labels and packing lists; (d) secure cargo — dunnage, strapping, and moisture protection for sea transit; (e) generate bill of lading (B/L) or RoRo manifest with per-store breakdown; (f) dispatch to port for vessel loading
Responsible (R): DC Shift Supervisor
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 4 hours/shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1255_Task8" name="In-transit monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: In-transit monitoring: Track inter-island shipment: (a) monitor vessel position via shipping line tracking API; (b) alert on schedule deviations — vessel delay &gt; 12 hours triggers notification to destination stores; (c) manage port congestion risk — if destination port congested, coordinate with 3PL for alternative discharge port; (d) update ETA in ERP for store receiving teams
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 30 min/day (continuous monitoring)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1255_Task9" name="Cost reconciliation &amp; optimization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cost reconciliation &amp; optimization: Monthly analysis of inter-island shipping costs: (a) calculate cost per CBM and cost per store delivery by route; (b) compare container vessel vs. RoRo cost-effectiveness by volume range; (c) identify opportunities to shift from LCL to FCL by consolidating shipments across additional days; (d) benchmark rates against alternative shipping lines; (e) present cost optimization recommendations to Finance Controller
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1255_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1255_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1255_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1255_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-256 (ensure controlled execution — Outbound Distribution (PA-06.1).) | - operational: Logistics Planner (Inter-Island) review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Logistics Planner (Inter-Island)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
